<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Luna Antonino Cano · 096matics</title>
		<link
			href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap"
			rel="stylesheet"
		/>
		<style>
			* {
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}
			html,
			body {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				height: 100%;
				overflow: hidden;
				overscroll-behavior: none;
				background: #0a0f0a;
			}
			body {
				height: 100dvh;
				font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
				color: #fff;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				position: relative;
				background: url('/tarjeta/personal-luna/fondo.jpg') no-repeat center center / cover;
			}
			.page {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 1;
				width: 100%;
				max-width: 430px;
				padding: 0 18px;
			}
			.photo-card {
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
				border-radius: 18px;
				aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
				background: url('/tarjeta/personal-luna/foto.jpg') no-repeat center 20% / cover;
				box-shadow: 0 25px 60px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
				animation: cardIn 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
			}
			@keyframes cardIn {
				from {
					opacity: 0;
					transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.98);
				}
				to {
					opacity: 1;
					transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
				}
			}
			.photo-card::after {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				background: linear-gradient(200deg, transparent 35%, rgba(10, 10, 8, 0.55) 65%, rgba(10, 10, 8, 0.8) 100%);
			}
			.photo-card::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				top: -20%;
				left: 55%;
				width: 60px;
				height: 180%;
				background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14), transparent);
				transform: rotate(18deg);
				z-index: 2;
				pointer-events: none;
			}
			.card-text {
				position: absolute;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				bottom: 0;
				z-index: 3;
				padding: 22px 20px 20px;
			}
			.role {
				font-size: 11.5px;
				letter-spacing: 0.14em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
				margin: 0 0 8px;
			}
			.name {
				font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
				font-weight: 600;
				font-size: 21px;
				margin: 0 0 12px;
			}
			.quote {
				font-size: 13px;
				line-height: 1.55;
				color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
				margin: 0;
				font-style: italic;
				max-width: 230px;
			}
			.icon-row {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: center;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 10px;
				margin: 20px 0 16px;
			}
			.icon-btn {
				width: 46px;
				height: 46px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				background: rgba(60, 60, 60, 0.55);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
				backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
				transition:
					background 0.15s ease,
					transform 0.15s ease;
			}
			.icon-btn:hover {
				background: rgba(85, 85, 85, 0.7);
				transform: translateY(-2px);
			}
			.icon-btn svg {
				width: 18px;
				height: 18px;
			}
			.cta {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				gap: 10px;
				padding: 15px;
				border-radius: 999px;
				background: rgba(60, 60, 60, 0.55);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
				backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 14.5px;
				font-weight: 500;
			}
			.cta:hover {
				background: rgba(85, 85, 85, 0.7);
			}
			.cta svg {
				width: 16px;
				height: 16px;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="page">
			<div class="photo-card">
				<div class="card-text">
					<p class="role">Integradora social</p>
					<h1 class="name">Luna Antonino Cano</h1>
					<p class="quote">
						"No puedes arreglar la vida de nadie, caminas a su lado mientras va reconstruyendo. Con paciencia, con
						cariño, y con la certeza de que nadie debería hacerlo solo."
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="icon-row">
				<a class="icon-btn" href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" aria-label="Instagram">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
						><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"
						></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1"></circle></svg
					>
				</a>
				<a class="icon-btn" href="https://facebook.com" target="_blank" aria-label="Facebook">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
						><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 00-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 011-1h3z"></path></svg
					>
				</a>
				<a class="icon-btn" href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" aria-label="LinkedIn">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
						><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 016 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 00-2-2 2 2 0 00-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 016-6z"></path><rect
							x="2"
							y="9"
							width="4"
							height="12"></rect><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg
					>
				</a>
				<a class="icon-btn" href="tel:+34727700065" aria-label="Teléfono">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
						><path
							d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"
						></path></svg
					>
				</a>
				<a class="icon-btn" href="mailto:contacto@096matics.com" aria-label="Email">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
						><path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg
					>
				</a>
			</div>

			<a class="cta" href="mailto:contacto@096matics.com">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
					><path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg
				>
				Ponte en contacto
			</a>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
